WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:16.980
life's not fair is it my little friend
while some are born to feast others

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.570
spend their lives in the dark

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:27.600
begging for scraps

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:40.120
everything you see 
exists together in a delicate balance

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:46.060
while others search for what they can
take

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.740
a true king searches for what he can give

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.780
run away Simba

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.720
and never return

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:21.480
you must take your place

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.800
in  the circle of life

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:44.960
[Timon and Pumbaa singing Hakuna Matata]

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.700
you

